{"product_id":"matcha-latte-250-grs","title":"Matcha Latte 250 Grs","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] thread-sm:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] thread-lg:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] thread-lg:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group\/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"b084feb1-da24-4a9f-b666-d91f422ce177\" dir=\"auto\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+\u0026amp;]:mt-1\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light markdown-new-styling\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"94\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"16\"\u003eMatcha Latte\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"16\" data-end=\"19\"\u003eCremosa y natural mezcla que combina el sabor vegetal y umami del matcha. Detox, quema de grasa y fortalecimiento del sistema inmune, son algunos beneficios del Matcha Latte.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"96\" data-end=\"473\"\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"211\" data-end=\"214\"\u003eGracias a sus propiedades de energía prolongada y sin efectos secundarios, nuestro Green Matcha Latte es una alternativa saludable y un gran complemento al café de la mañana.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"96\" data-end=\"473\"\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"383\"\u003eRevitaliza cuerpo y mente, entregando claridad, concentración y bienestar en cada sorbo.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"486\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"484\"\u003e250 g\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"527\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"505\"\u003eIngredientes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"508\"\u003eMatcha y alulosa.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"701\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"699\"\u003ePreparación:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003col data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"869\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"740\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"740\"\u003eAgrega 5 g de polvo en una taza.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"785\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"785\"\u003eDisuélvelo en un poco de agua caliente.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"869\" data-is-last-node=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"869\" data-is-last-node=\"\"\u003eIncorpora 200 ml de leche caliente y revuelve. Idealmente usa leche texturizada.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ol\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"569\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003eTómalo caliente o con hielo, según prefieras.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Blackdrop Coffee","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":51226869072154,"sku":"OLAT7028","price":12990.0,"currency_code":"CLP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0784\/1395\/5354\/files\/matcha-latte-250-grs-9151458.jpg?v=1778077337","url":"https:\/\/blackdrop.cl\/products\/matcha-latte-250-grs","provider":"Blackdrop Coffee","version":"1.0","type":"link"}